# What a release needs from the probe it runs on, read by the root Makefile
# into the bundle's release.env:
# MIN_IMAGE  the oldest image the release runs on. Raise it when the release
#            needs something older images lack: a new s6 service, a system
#            library, a capability. Such a release cannot reach a probe over
#            xray-pwc-net: the probe's owner pulls the new image.
# ALLOY_VERSION, CADDY_VERSION  the tools, named by version: the image has
#            those of its own release, Ansible brings others into /app/opt.
MIN_IMAGE=1.1.0
ALLOY_VERSION=v1.20.0
CADDY_VERSION=2.11.7
